        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Suicidal thoughts and safety"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports passive thoughts of “what’s the point”; denies plan or intent and says she would not act because her Nan would be upset. Future-oriented, discussing having her own place and doing a course. No current self-harm or harm to others reported; no past attempts disclosed. Reliability of assessment is limited."
      }
