          "text": "Mental status examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Casually dressed, fidgety, skin picking; mildly disinhibited but cooperative. Speech normal in rate and volume, tangential. Affect mildly labile, mostly euthymic to slightly irritable. Thought form circumstantial and concrete. Developmental delay noted; oriented to person and place but not date, with poor recall. Insight and judgement limited."
      }
